Introduction to Git
Git is a version control system. it keeps track of every change i make to my files.
it saves a history so i can go back to older version if i need to.
i use it to keep my work safe and organised.
CLI - Command line interface
CLI is where i type commands instead of clicking buttons. i learned some basic commands like:
'ls' - lists files
'cd' - changes folder
'git status' - checks my files
